| `input_adb_lookup(fetched.csv)`
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach nt_host [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="fetched.csv", "fetched")
```### Shallow merge assets with matching key fields (using basic stats) ###```
| eval _key = nt_host
| search _key=*
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, values(nt_host) as nt_host by _key
```### Deep merge assets with matching key fields (using custom command) ###```
| eval _key = nt_host
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, values(nt_host) as nt_host by _key
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval nt_host = mvindex(nt_host,0,4)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, nt_host
| outputlookup assetdb
